# H1b2 deny by default. Literal reviewed source files only; no directory/glob reinclusion.
# Docker sends this ignore file as build control metadata even though excluded.
# The future Host wrapper must also use the reviewed source-only staging archive.
# A file path replaced by a directory must not admit any descendants.
